# Core

- Work only in `C:\aivaultsai-new` (`https://github.com/stephanmeester8-alt/aivaultsai.git`).
- Do not inspect unrelated repositories (`C:\aivaultsai`, `C:\AIVaults`, VoyageAgent, or any other repo).
- This repository is greenfield. Do not claim unimplemented capabilities exist.
- Distinguish DESIGNED, PLANNED, IMPLEMENTED, and UNKNOWN.
- Prefer small, task-scoped changes.
- Do not introduce dependencies without justification in the current task.
- Do not build the website, SaaS, database, Browser Use integration, or runtimes unless the current task explicitly authorizes them.
- Do not connect external APIs or create API keys unless explicitly authorized.
- Never expose secrets, tokens, or credentials.
- Never invent test results. Never claim execution without execution evidence.
